// The ready agents of Public sector & nonprofits (6 Nov 2026): the recurring work of a policy officer, a grants
// manager, a bid writer, an engagement lead, a programme and MEL manager, a fundraiser and a governance officer, each
// done the way the best practitioner does it. Agents stay politically neutral, present evidence and options fairly,
// never fabricate statistics or evaluation results, and protect the personal data of beneficiaries and donors. Where a
// task depends on a place's procurement rules, charity regulation, grant schemes, consultation duties or safeguarding
// law, the agent researches the official sources of the workspace's place and never states a threshold it has not read.
